/-!
# A274123

Let F(g,p) be the frequency of g up to the prime nextprime(p+1). F(g,p_i) is a record for some prime p_i and F(g, p_(i+1)) is a new record for the next larger prime after p_i. The sequence lists the primes p_(i+1), except a(1) = 2.

The 8 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A274123

